"use strict";(self.webpackChunk_N_E=self.webpackChunk_N_E||[]).push([[72826],{72826:function(n){n.exports=JSON.parse('{"content":"\\n## Linux DRM - open()과 ioctl() 코드 흐름\\n```require\\n- Kernel: Linux v6.19 소스 기준\\n- Library: libdrm 2.4.129\\n- 선행 글: Linux DRM 2편 코어 초기화와 드라이버 등록\\n```\\n### Introduction\\n| 편 | 주제 |\\n|---|---|\\n| 1편 | <a href=\\"/posts/content/2026-10-26-post-linux-drm-01-architecture\\">구조와 전체 그림</a> |\\n| 2편 | <a href=\\"/posts/content/2026-10-27-post-linux-drm-02-register\\">코어 초기화와 드라이버 등록</a> |\\n\\n2편에서 `/dev/dri/card0` 같은 노드가 만들어지는 과정을 봤습니다. 이 글은 유저가 그 노드를 쓰는 순간, 즉 <b>`open()`</b>과 <b>`ioctl()`</b>이 커널 안에서 어떤 함수들을 거치는지 따라갑니다. 마지막에는 같은 일을 유저 공간에서 libdrm으로 해 보는 예제를 봅니다.  \\n\\n\\n```adcard\\n```\\n\\n### Code Flow 3: open()\\n유저가 `open(\\"/dev/dri/card0\\")`를 호출하면 커널은 주 번호 226으로 앞서 등록한 <b>stub fops</b>를 찾습니다. stub은 진짜 일을 하지 않고 <b>파일 연산 표를 드라이버의 것으로 갈아 끼웁니다</b>.  \\n\\n```c\\n{\\n    \\"title\\": \\"drivers/gpu/drm/drm_drv.c - drm_stub_open() (L1188-1216)\\"\\n}\\n---\\nstatic int drm_stub_open(struct inode *inode, struct file *filp)\\n{\\n\\tconst struct file_operations *new_fops;\\n\\tstruct drm_minor *minor;\\n\\tint err;\\n\\n\\tDRM_DEBUG(\\"\\\\n\\");\\n\\n\\tminor = drm_minor_acquire(&drm_minors_xa, iminor(inode));  // [!code highlight]\\n\\tif (IS_ERR(minor))\\n\\t\\treturn PTR_ERR(minor);\\n\\n\\tnew_fops = fops_get(minor->dev->driver->fops);\\n\\tif (!new_fops) {\\n\\t\\terr = -ENODEV;\\n\\t\\tgoto out;\\n\\t}\\n\\n\\treplace_fops(filp, new_fops);  // [!code highlight]\\n\\tif (filp->f_op->open)  // [!code highlight]\\n\\t\\terr = filp->f_op->open(inode, filp);  // [!code highlight]\\n\\telse\\n\\t\\terr = 0;\\n\\nout:\\n\\tdrm_minor_release(minor);\\n\\n\\treturn err;\\n}\\n```\\n\\n> **소스** <a href=\\"https://github.com/torvalds/linux/blob/v6.19/drivers/gpu/drm/drm_drv.c#L1188-L1216\\" target=\\"_blank\\">drivers/gpu/drm/drm_drv.c L1188-L1216</a> (Linux v6.19)\\n\\n```mermaid\\n{\\n    \\"title\\": \\"open(\\\\\\"/dev/dri/card0\\\\\\") 처리 흐름\\"\\n}\\n---\\nsequenceDiagram\\n    participant U as 유저 프로세스\\n    participant V as VFS (chrdev 226)\\n    participant S as drm_stub_open\\n    participant O as drm_open / drm_open_helper\\n    U->>V: open(\\"/dev/dri/card0\\")\\n    V->>S: drm_stub_fops.open\\n    S->>S: drm_minor_acquire(iminor(inode))<br/>→ struct drm_minor\\n    S->>S: replace_fops(filp, driver->fops)\\n    S->>O: filp->f_op->open()  (= drm_open)\\n    O->>O: drm_file_alloc() → struct drm_file\\n    O->>O: primary라면 drm_master_open()\\n    O-->>U: fd\\n```\\n드라이버의 `fops`가 가진 `.open`은 `drm_open()`입니다. 이것은 매크로 한 줄에서 옵니다.  \\n\\n```c\\n{\\n    \\"title\\": \\"include/drm/drm_gem.h - #define DRM_GEM_FOPS (L464-473)\\"\\n}\\n---\\n#define DRM_GEM_FOPS \\\\\\n\\t.open\\t\\t= drm_open,\\\\\\n\\t.release\\t= drm_release,\\\\\\n\\t.unlocked_ioctl\\t= drm_ioctl,\\\\\\n\\t.compat_ioctl\\t= drm_compat_ioctl,\\\\\\n\\t.poll\\t\\t= drm_poll,\\\\\\n\\t.read\\t\\t= drm_read,\\\\\\n\\t.llseek\\t\\t= noop_llseek,\\\\\\n\\t.mmap\\t\\t= drm_gem_mmap, \\\\\\n\\t.fop_flags\\t= FOP_UNSIGNED_OFFSET\\n```\\n\\n> **소스** <a href=\\"https://github.com/torvalds/linux/blob/v6.19/include/drm/drm_gem.h#L464-L473\\" target=\\"_blank\\">include/drm/drm_gem.h L464-L473</a> (Linux v6.19)\\n\\n이 매크로 안에 앞으로 시리즈에서 보게 될 <b>모든 진입점</b>이 있습니다. `.unlocked_ioctl = drm_ioctl`(ioctl), `.read = drm_read`(이벤트 읽기), `.mmap = drm_gem_mmap`(버퍼 매핑), `.poll = drm_poll`입니다. `drm_open()`과 `drm_open_helper()`는 다음과 같습니다.  \\n\\n```c\\n{\\n    \\"title\\": \\"drivers/gpu/drm/drm_file.c - drm_open() (L369-403)\\"\\n}\\n---\\nint drm_open(struct inode *inode, struct file *filp)\\n{\\n\\tstruct drm_device *dev;\\n\\tstruct drm_minor *minor;\\n\\tint retcode;\\n\\n\\tminor = drm_minor_acquire(&drm_minors_xa, iminor(inode));  // [!code highlight]\\n\\tif (IS_ERR(minor))\\n\\t\\treturn PTR_ERR(minor);\\n\\n\\tdev = minor->dev;\\n\\tif (drm_dev_needs_global_mutex(dev))\\n\\t\\tmutex_lock(&drm_global_mutex);\\n\\n\\tatomic_fetch_inc(&dev->open_count);\\n\\n\\tfilp->f_mapping = dev->anon_inode->i_mapping;\\n\\n\\tretcode = drm_open_helper(filp, minor);  // [!code highlight]\\n\\tif (retcode)\\n\\t\\tgoto err_undo;\\n\\n\\tif (drm_dev_needs_global_mutex(dev))\\n\\t\\tmutex_unlock(&drm_global_mutex);\\n\\n\\treturn 0;\\n\\nerr_undo:\\n\\tatomic_dec(&dev->open_count);\\n\\tif (drm_dev_needs_global_mutex(dev))\\n\\t\\tmutex_unlock(&drm_global_mutex);\\n\\tdrm_minor_release(minor);\\n\\treturn retcode;\\n}\\n```\\n\\n> **소스** <a href=\\"https://github.com/torvalds/linux/blob/v6.19/drivers/gpu/drm/drm_file.c#L369-L403\\" target=\\"_blank\\">drivers/gpu/drm/drm_file.c L369-L403</a> (Linux v6.19)\\n\\n`drm_open()`은 minor를 찾고 `drm_open_helper()`에 넘깁니다.  \\n\\n```c\\n{\\n    \\"title\\": \\"drivers/gpu/drm/drm_file.c - drm_open_helper() (L316-355)\\"\\n}\\n---\\nint drm_open_helper(struct file *filp, struct drm_minor *minor)\\n{\\n\\tstruct drm_device *dev = minor->dev;\\n\\tstruct drm_file *priv;\\n\\tint ret;\\n\\n\\tif (filp->f_flags & O_EXCL)\\n\\t\\treturn -EBUSY;\\n\\tif (!drm_cpu_valid())\\n\\t\\treturn -EINVAL;\\n\\tif (dev->switch_power_state != DRM_SWITCH_POWER_ON &&\\n\\t    dev->switch_power_state != DRM_SWITCH_POWER_DYNAMIC_OFF)\\n\\t\\treturn -EINVAL;\\n\\tif (WARN_ON_ONCE(!(filp->f_op->fop_flags & FOP_UNSIGNED_OFFSET)))\\n\\t\\treturn -EINVAL;\\n\\n\\tdrm_dbg_core(dev, \\"comm=\\\\\\"%s\\\\\\", pid=%d, minor=%d\\\\n\\",\\n\\t\\t     current->comm, task_pid_nr(current), minor->index);\\n\\n\\tpriv = drm_file_alloc(minor);  // [!code highlight]\\n\\tif (IS_ERR(priv))\\n\\t\\treturn PTR_ERR(priv);\\n\\n\\tif (drm_is_primary_client(priv)) {\\n\\t\\tret = drm_master_open(priv);  // [!code highlight]\\n\\t\\tif (ret) {\\n\\t\\t\\tdrm_file_free(priv);\\n\\t\\t\\treturn ret;\\n\\t\\t}\\n\\t}\\n\\n\\tfilp->private_data = priv;  // [!code highlight]\\n\\tpriv->filp = filp;\\n\\n\\tmutex_lock(&dev->filelist_mutex);\\n\\tlist_add(&priv->lhead, &dev->filelist);\\n\\tmutex_unlock(&dev->filelist_mutex);\\n\\n\\treturn 0;\\n}\\n```\\n\\n> **소스** <a href=\\"https://github.com/torvalds/linux/blob/v6.19/drivers/gpu/drm/drm_file.c#L316-L355\\" target=\\"_blank\\">drivers/gpu/drm/drm_file.c L316-L355</a> (Linux v6.19)\\n\\n`drm_file_alloc()`이 `open()` 하나에 해당하는 상태를 만듭니다. 앞서 본 `object_idr`, 이벤트 큐 등이 여기서 초기화됩니다.  \\n\\n\\n```adcard\\n```\\n\\n\\n```c\\n{\\n    \\"title\\": \\"drivers/gpu/drm/drm_file.c - drm_file_alloc() (L132-197)\\"\\n}\\n---\\nstruct drm_file *drm_file_alloc(struct drm_minor *minor)\\n{\\n\\t/* ... */\\n\\tfile = kzalloc(sizeof(*file), GFP_KERNEL);\\n\\t/* ... */\\n\\tfile->minor = minor;\\n\\n\\tfile->authenticated = capable(CAP_SYS_ADMIN);  // [!code highlight]\\n\\t/* ... */\\n\\tINIT_LIST_HEAD(&file->fbs);\\n\\tmutex_init(&file->fbs_lock);\\n\\tINIT_LIST_HEAD(&file->blobs);\\n\\tINIT_LIST_HEAD(&file->pending_event_list);\\n\\tINIT_LIST_HEAD(&file->event_list);\\n\\tinit_waitqueue_head(&file->event_wait);\\n\\tfile->event_space = 4096;  // [!code highlight]\\n\\t/* ... */\\n\\tif (drm_core_check_feature(dev, DRIVER_GEM))\\n\\t\\tdrm_gem_open(dev, file);  // [!code highlight]\\n\\n\\tif (drm_core_check_feature(dev, DRIVER_SYNCOBJ))\\n\\t\\tdrm_syncobj_open(file);  // [!code highlight]\\n\\n\\tdrm_prime_init_file_private(&file->prime);  // [!code highlight]\\n\\t/* ... */\\n\\tif (dev->driver->open) {\\n\\t\\tret = dev->driver->open(dev, file);\\n\\t\\tif (ret < 0)\\n\\t\\t\\tgoto out_prime_destroy;\\n\\t}\\n\\n\\treturn file;\\n\\t/* ... */\\n}\\n```\\n\\n> **소스** <a href=\\"https://github.com/torvalds/linux/blob/v6.19/drivers/gpu/drm/drm_file.c#L132-L197\\" target=\\"_blank\\">drivers/gpu/drm/drm_file.c L132-L197</a> (Linux v6.19)\\n\\n<mark>drm_gem_open()</mark>이 handle 표를 초기화하는데, 이 호출은 `idr_init_base(&file_private->object_idr, 1)`입니다. handle 번호가 <b>1부터</b> 시작하는 이유가 여기 있습니다(0은 \\"없음\\"으로 쓰기 위해서입니다). `filp->private_data = priv` 덕분에 이후의 모든 `ioctl`, `read`, `mmap`은 `file->private_data`에서 `drm_file`을 바로 얻습니다.  \\n\\n### Code Flow 4: ioctl()\\n`ioctl(fd, DRM_IOCTL_xxx, arg)`은 `fops->unlocked_ioctl`인 <mark>drm_ioctl()</mark>로 들어옵니다.  \\n\\n```mermaid\\n{\\n    \\"title\\": \\"drm_ioctl() 의 디스패치\\"\\n}\\n---\\nflowchart TD\\n    A[\\"ioctl(fd, DRM_IOCTL_xxx, arg)\\"] --> B[\\"drm_ioctl()\\"]\\n    B --> C{\\"nr ≥ DRM_COMMAND_BASE<br/>(0x40) ?\\"}\\n    C -->|\\"예 : 드라이버 ioctl\\"| D[\\"dev->driver->ioctls[nr - 0x40]\\"]\\n    C -->|\\"아니오 : 코어 ioctl\\"| E[\\"drm_ioctls[nr]\\"]\\n    D --> F[\\"copy_from_user → kdata\\"]\\n    E --> F\\n    F --> G[\\"drm_ioctl_kernel()\\"]\\n    G --> H{\\"drm_ioctl_permit()<br/>AUTH \xb7 MASTER \xb7 ROOT_ONLY \xb7 RENDER_ALLOW\\"}\\n    H -->|\\"거부\\"| I[\\"-EACCES\\"]\\n    H -->|\\"통과\\"| J[\\"func(dev, kdata, file_priv)\\"]\\n    J --> K[\\"copy_to_user → 결과\\"]\\n```\\n```c\\n{\\n    \\"title\\": \\"drivers/gpu/drm/drm_ioctl.c - drm_ioctl() (L821-919)\\"\\n}\\n---\\nlong drm_ioctl(struct file *filp,\\n\\t      unsigned int cmd, unsigned long arg)\\n{\\n\\t/* ... */\\n\\tunsigned int nr = DRM_IOCTL_NR(cmd);\\n\\t/* ... */\\n\\tdev = file_priv->minor->dev;\\n\\n\\tif (drm_dev_is_unplugged(dev))\\n\\t\\treturn -ENODEV;\\n\\n\\tif (DRM_IOCTL_TYPE(cmd) != DRM_IOCTL_BASE)\\n\\t\\treturn -ENOTTY;\\n\\t/* ... */\\n\\tis_driver_ioctl = nr >= DRM_COMMAND_BASE && nr < DRM_COMMAND_END;  // [!code highlight]\\n\\n\\tif (is_driver_ioctl) {\\n\\t\\tunsigned int index = nr - DRM_COMMAND_BASE;  // [!code highlight]\\n\\n\\t\\tif (index >= dev->driver->num_ioctls)\\n\\t\\t\\tgoto err_i1;\\n\\t\\tindex = array_index_nospec(index, dev->driver->num_ioctls);\\n\\t\\tioctl = &dev->driver->ioctls[index];  // [!code highlight]\\n\\t} else {\\n\\t\\tif (nr >= DRM_CORE_IOCTL_COUNT)\\n\\t\\t\\tgoto err_i1;\\n\\t\\tnr = array_index_nospec(nr, DRM_CORE_IOCTL_COUNT);\\n\\t\\tioctl = &drm_ioctls[nr];  // [!code highlight]\\n\\t}\\n\\t/* ... */\\n\\tfunc = ioctl->func;\\n\\t/* ... */\\n\\tif (copy_from_user(kdata, (void __user *)arg, in_size) != 0) {  // [!code highlight]\\n\\t\\tretcode = -EFAULT;\\n\\t\\tgoto err_i1;\\n\\t}\\n\\n\\tif (ksize > in_size)\\n\\t\\tmemset(kdata + in_size, 0, ksize - in_size);\\n\\n\\tretcode = drm_ioctl_kernel(filp, func, kdata, ioctl->flags);  // [!code highlight]\\n\\tif (copy_to_user((void __user *)arg, kdata, out_size) != 0)  // [!code highlight]\\n\\t\\tretcode = -EFAULT;\\n\\t/* ... */\\n}\\n```\\n\\n> **소스** <a href=\\"https://github.com/torvalds/linux/blob/v6.19/drivers/gpu/drm/drm_ioctl.c#L821-L919\\" target=\\"_blank\\">drivers/gpu/drm/drm_ioctl.c L821-L919</a> (Linux v6.19)\\n\\n핵심만 정리하면 이렇습니다.  \\n\\n1. ioctl 번호의 `type`이 `\'d\'`(`DRM_IOCTL_BASE`)인지 확인합니다.\\n2. 번호가 <mark>0x40 이상이면 드라이버 표</mark>(`dev->driver->ioctls`), 아니면 <mark>코어 표</mark>(`drm_ioctls[]`)에서 항목을 찾습니다.\\n3. 유저가 준 크기를 믿지 않고 <b>커널에 있는 정의(`ioctl->cmd`)</b>로 버퍼 크기를 계산합니다(`Do not trust userspace`).\\n4. `copy_from_user()` 후 `drm_ioctl_kernel()`이 <b>권한을 검사</b>하고 실제 함수를 부릅니다.\\n\\n```c\\n{\\n    \\"title\\": \\"drivers/gpu/drm/drm_ioctl.c - drm_ioctl_kernel() (L787-805)\\"\\n}\\n---\\nlong drm_ioctl_kernel(struct file *file, drm_ioctl_t *func, void *kdata,\\n\\t\\t      u32 flags)\\n{\\n\\tstruct drm_file *file_priv = file->private_data;\\n\\tstruct drm_device *dev = file_priv->minor->dev;\\n\\tint ret;\\n\\n\\tdrm_file_update_pid(file_priv);\\n\\n\\tif (drm_dev_is_unplugged(dev))\\n\\t\\treturn -ENODEV;\\n\\n\\tret = drm_ioctl_permit(flags, file_priv);\\n\\tif (unlikely(ret))\\n\\t\\treturn ret;\\n\\n\\treturn func(dev, kdata, file_priv);\\n}\\n```\\n\\n> **소스** <a href=\\"https://github.com/torvalds/linux/blob/v6.19/drivers/gpu/drm/drm_ioctl.c#L787-L805\\" target=\\"_blank\\">drivers/gpu/drm/drm_ioctl.c L787-L805</a> (Linux v6.19)\\n\\n코어 ioctl 표는 매크로로 만든 배열입니다. 이 시리즈에서 만날 항목만 골라 보면 다음과 같습니다. 오른쪽 끝의 <b>플래그</b>가 앞서 본 권한 규칙입니다.  \\n\\n```c\\n{\\n    \\"title\\": \\"drivers/gpu/drm/drm_ioctl.c - drm_ioctls (L632-735)\\"\\n}\\n---\\nstatic const struct drm_ioctl_desc drm_ioctls[] = {\\n\\tDRM_IOCTL_DEF(DRM_IOCTL_VERSION, drm_version, DRM_RENDER_ALLOW),  // [!code highlight]\\n\\t/* ... */\\n\\tDRM_IOCTL_DEF(DRM_IOCTL_SET_MASTER, drm_setmaster_ioctl, 0),\\n\\t/* ... */\\n\\tDRM_IOCTL_DEF(DRM_IOCTL_GEM_CLOSE, drm_gem_close_ioctl, DRM_RENDER_ALLOW),  // [!code highlight]\\n\\t/* ... */\\n\\tDRM_IOCTL_DEF(DRM_IOCTL_MODE_GETRESOURCES, drm_mode_getresources, 0),\\n\\tDRM_IOCTL_DEF(DRM_IOCTL_PRIME_HANDLE_TO_FD, drm_prime_handle_to_fd_ioctl, DRM_RENDER_ALLOW),  // [!code highlight]\\n\\t/* ... */\\n\\tDRM_IOCTL_DEF(DRM_IOCTL_MODE_CREATE_DUMB, drm_mode_create_dumb_ioctl, 0),\\n\\tDRM_IOCTL_DEF(DRM_IOCTL_MODE_MAP_DUMB, drm_mode_mmap_dumb_ioctl, 0),\\n\\t/* ... */\\n\\tDRM_IOCTL_DEF(DRM_IOCTL_MODE_ATOMIC, drm_mode_atomic_ioctl, DRM_MASTER),  // [!code highlight]\\n\\t/* ... */\\n};\\n```\\n\\n> **소스** <a href=\\"https://github.com/torvalds/linux/blob/v6.19/drivers/gpu/drm/drm_ioctl.c#L632-L735\\" target=\\"_blank\\">drivers/gpu/drm/drm_ioctl.c L632-L735</a> (Linux v6.19)\\n\\n\\n```adcard\\n```\\n\\n### libdrm: The View from User Space\\n이제 유저 공간에서 위 흐름을 직접 따라가 보겠습니다. 아래 프로그램은 DRM 장치를 열어서 드라이버 정보와 KMS 객체를 나열합니다.  \\n\\n```c\\n{\\n    \\"title\\": \\"drm_probe.c - 드라이버 정보와 KMS 객체 나열\\",\\n    \\"ln\\": true\\n}\\n---\\n// drm_probe.c — DRM 장치를 열어서 드라이버 정보와 KMS 객체(CRTC, connector, plane)를 나열한다.\\n#include <fcntl.h>\\n#include <stdio.h>\\n#include <stdlib.h>\\n#include <string.h>\\n#include <unistd.h>\\n#include <xf86drm.h>\\n#include <xf86drmMode.h>\\n\\nstatic const char *plane_type(int fd, uint32_t plane_id)\\n{\\n\\tstatic const char *names[] = { \\"overlay\\", \\"primary\\", \\"cursor\\" };\\n\\tdrmModeObjectProperties *props =\\n\\t\\tdrmModeObjectGetProperties(fd, plane_id, DRM_MODE_OBJECT_PLANE);\\n\\tconst char *ret = \\"?\\";\\n\\n\\tfor (uint32_t i = 0; props && i < props->count_props; i++) {\\n\\t\\tdrmModePropertyRes *p = drmModeGetProperty(fd, props->props[i]);\\n\\t\\tif (p && !strcmp(p->name, \\"type\\") && props->prop_values[i] < 3)\\n\\t\\t\\tret = names[props->prop_values[i]];\\n\\t\\tdrmModeFreeProperty(p);\\n\\t}\\n\\tdrmModeFreeObjectProperties(props);\\n\\treturn ret;\\n}\\n\\nint main(int argc, char **argv)\\n{\\n\\tconst char *path = argc > 1 ? argv[1] : \\"/dev/dri/card0\\";\\n\\tint fd = open(path, O_RDWR | O_CLOEXEC);\\n\\n\\tif (fd < 0) { perror(path); return 1; }\\n\\n\\tdrmVersionPtr v = drmGetVersion(fd);  // [!code highlight]\\n\\tprintf(\\"driver : %s %d.%d.%d (%s)\\\\n\\", v->name, v->version_major,\\n\\t       v->version_minor, v->version_patchlevel, v->desc);\\n\\tdrmFreeVersion(v);\\n\\n\\tuint64_t cap;\\n\\tif (!drmGetCap(fd, DRM_CAP_DUMB_BUFFER, &cap))  // [!code highlight]\\n\\t\\tprintf(\\"cap    : DUMB_BUFFER=%llu\\\\n\\", (unsigned long long)cap);\\n\\tif (!drmGetCap(fd, DRM_CAP_PRIME, &cap))  // [!code highlight]\\n\\t\\tprintf(\\"cap    : PRIME=0x%llx (import=%d, export=%d)\\\\n\\", (unsigned long long)cap,\\n\\t\\t       !!(cap & DRM_PRIME_CAP_IMPORT), !!(cap & DRM_PRIME_CAP_EXPORT));\\n\\n\\t// atomic을 쓰려면 파일(fd)마다 먼저 켜야 한다 — 커널의 file_priv->atomic이 이 값이다.\\n\\tprintf(\\"client : UNIVERSAL_PLANES=%d ATOMIC=%d\\\\n\\",\\n\\t       !drmSetClientCap(fd, DRM_CLIENT_CAP_UNIVERSAL_PLANES, 1),  // [!code highlight]\\n\\t       !drmSetClientCap(fd, DRM_CLIENT_CAP_ATOMIC, 1));  // [!code highlight]\\n\\n\\tdrmModeRes *res = drmModeGetResources(fd);  // [!code highlight]\\n\\tif (!res) { perror(\\"drmModeGetResources\\"); return 1; }  // [!code highlight]\\n\\tprintf(\\"crtcs=%d encoders=%d connectors=%d\\\\n\\", res->count_crtcs,\\n\\t       res->count_encoders, res->count_connectors);\\n\\n\\tfor (int i = 0; i < res->count_connectors; i++) {\\n\\t\\tdrmModeConnector *c = drmModeGetConnector(fd, res->connectors[i]);\\n\\t\\tprintf(\\"  connector %u: %s-%u %s, %d modes\\", c->connector_id,\\n\\t\\t       drmModeGetConnectorTypeName(c->connector_type), c->connector_type_id,\\n\\t\\t       c->connection == DRM_MODE_CONNECTED ? \\"connected\\" : \\"disconnected\\",\\n\\t\\t       c->count_modes);\\n\\t\\tif (c->count_modes)\\n\\t\\t\\tprintf(\\", preferred %s @%uHz\\", c->modes[0].name, c->modes[0].vrefresh);\\n\\t\\tprintf(\\"\\\\n\\");\\n\\t\\tdrmModeFreeConnector(c);\\n\\t}\\n\\n\\tdrmModePlaneRes *pr = drmModeGetPlaneResources(fd);  // [!code highlight]\\n\\tfor (uint32_t i = 0; pr && i < pr->count_planes; i++) {\\n\\t\\tdrmModePlane *p = drmModeGetPlane(fd, pr->planes[i]);\\n\\t\\tprintf(\\"  plane %u: %s, possible_crtcs=0x%x, %u formats\\\\n\\", p->plane_id,\\n\\t\\t       plane_type(fd, p->plane_id), p->possible_crtcs, p->count_formats);\\n\\t\\tdrmModeFreePlane(p);\\n\\t}\\n\\tdrmModeFreePlaneResources(pr);\\n\\tdrmModeFreeResources(res);\\n\\tclose(fd);\\n\\treturn 0;\\n}\\n```\\n각 libdrm 함수는 <b>커널 ioctl 하나</b>로 이어집니다. 위 코드에서 `drm_ioctls[]` 표의 이름을 그대로 찾아볼 수 있습니다.  \\n\\n| libdrm 함수 | ioctl | 커널 핸들러 | 플래그 |\\n|---|---|---|---|\\n| `drmGetVersion()` | `DRM_IOCTL_VERSION` | `drm_version()` | RENDER_ALLOW |\\n| `drmGetCap()` | `DRM_IOCTL_GET_CAP` | `drm_getcap()` | RENDER_ALLOW |\\n| `drmSetClientCap()` | `DRM_IOCTL_SET_CLIENT_CAP` | `drm_setclientcap()` | 없음 |\\n| `drmModeGetResources()` | `DRM_IOCTL_MODE_GETRESOURCES` | `drm_mode_getresources()` | 없음 |\\n| `drmModeGetConnector()` | `DRM_IOCTL_MODE_GETCONNECTOR` | `drm_mode_getconnector()` | 없음 |\\n| `drmModeGetPlaneResources()` | `DRM_IOCTL_MODE_GETPLANERESOURCES` | `drm_mode_getplane_res()` | 없음 |\\n| `drmModeObjectGetProperties()` | `DRM_IOCTL_MODE_OBJ_GETPROPERTIES` | `drm_mode_obj_get_properties_ioctl()` | 없음 |\\n\\n이 프로그램은 `libdrm 2.4.129`로 컴파일되는 것을 확인했습니다. 실행하려면 `/dev/dri/card0`에 접근 권한이 필요합니다(데스크톱 로그인 세션이면 보통 가능하고, 아니면 `video`/`render` 그룹이 필요합니다). `strace -e trace=openat,ioctl ./drm_probe`로 실행하면 유저가 호출하는 ioctl 순서를 볼 수 있습니다(strace 버전에 따라 `DRM_IOCTL_VERSION` 같은 이름까지 풀어서 보여 줍니다).  \\n\\n### Code Locations\\n| 단계 | 함수 | 위치 (Linux v6.19) |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| open: 파일 상태 만들기 | `drm_open_helper()` | <a href=\\"https://github.com/torvalds/linux/blob/v6.19/drivers/gpu/drm/drm_file.c#L316-L355\\" target=\\"_blank\\">drivers/gpu/drm/drm_file.c:316</a> |\\n| open: drm_file 할당 | `drm_file_alloc()` | <a href=\\"https://github.com/torvalds/linux/blob/v6.19/drivers/gpu/drm/drm_file.c#L132-L197\\" target=\\"_blank\\">drivers/gpu/drm/drm_file.c:132</a> |\\n| open: master 지정 | `drm_master_open()` | <a href=\\"https://github.com/torvalds/linux/blob/v6.19/drivers/gpu/drm/drm_auth.c#L317-L335\\" target=\\"_blank\\">drivers/gpu/drm/drm_auth.c:317</a> |\\n| ioctl: 진입과 디스패치 | `drm_ioctl()` | <a href=\\"https://github.com/torvalds/linux/blob/v6.19/drivers/gpu/drm/drm_ioctl.c#L821-L919\\" target=\\"_blank\\">drivers/gpu/drm/drm_ioctl.c:821</a> |\\n| ioctl: 권한 검사 | `drm_ioctl_permit()` | <a href=\\"https://github.com/torvalds/linux/blob/v6.19/drivers/gpu/drm/drm_ioctl.c#L599-L621\\" target=\\"_blank\\">drivers/gpu/drm/drm_ioctl.c:599</a> |\\n| ioctl: 코어 ioctl 표 | `drm_ioctls` | <a href=\\"https://github.com/torvalds/linux/blob/v6.19/drivers/gpu/drm/drm_ioctl.c#L632-L735\\" target=\\"_blank\\">drivers/gpu/drm/drm_ioctl.c:632</a> |\\n\\n\\n```adcard\\n```\\n\\n### Summary\\n이 Post 에서 확인한 것은 다음과 같습니다.  \\n\\n- <b>open</b>: stub이 드라이버의 fops로 갈아 끼우고, `drm_file_alloc()`이 `open()` 하나의 상태(handle 표, 이벤트 큐)를 만듭니다.\\n- <b>ioctl</b>: `drm_ioctl()`이 코어 표와 드라이버 표에서 항목을 찾고, `drm_ioctl_permit()`이 권한을 검사한 뒤 핸들러를 부릅니다.\\n- libdrm 함수는 대부분 이 `ioctl`의 얇은 포장입니다.\\n\\n다음부터는 렌더링 쪽입니다. 먼저 `drm_file`의 `object_idr`에 들어 있는 <b>GEM handle</b>이 어떻게 만들어지고, 그 버퍼를 CPU에서 어떻게 읽고 쓰는지 봅니다.  \\n"}')}}]);